---
/**
 * Animated chat mock for the homepage hero. Pure CSS keyframe loop (no JS).
 */
---

<div class="hc">
  <div class="hc-body">
    <div class="hc-static-pair">
      <div class="hc-prior-user">Which vendors renew this quarter?</div>
      <div class="hc-prior-reply">Three renewals fall before quarter end: Acme Cloud (Oct 4), Vantage Analytics (Oct 19) and Northwind IT (Nov 2).</div>
    </div>

    <div class="hc-user-msg">What did we pay Northwind last year?</div>

    <div class="hc-tool-card">
      <div class="hc-tool-text">
        <div class="hc-tool-title">Run tool · records.search</div>
        <div class="hc-sub">READ · CONFIRMATION REQUIRED</div>
      </div>
      <button class="hc-approve" type="button" tabindex="-1">Approve</button>
    </div>

    <div class="hc-status-slot">
      <div class="hc-thinking"><span class="hc-thinking-dot"></span>Reading local file…</div>
      <div class="hc-reply">Northwind IT was paid $184,200 across four invoices in FY2025, all settled on time.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="hc-composer">
      <div class="hc-input-row">
        <span class="hc-placeholder">Ask about your files…</span>
        <span class="hc-typed">What did we pay Northwind last year?</span>
        <span class="hc-caret"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-bottom-row">
        <div class="hc-bottom-left">
          <span class="hc-plus">+</span>
          <span class="hc-file-chip">vendor-msa.pdf</span>
        </div>
        <button class="hc-send" type="button" tabindex="-1">↑</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
